<title>UK: WuerttembergHypo sets 1.0 bln mark bond.</title>
<headline>WuerttembergHypo sets 1.0 bln mark bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by joint leads Hypobank, Commerzbank, Deutsche Morgan Grenfell, Dresdner Kleinwort Benson and Trinkaus &amp; Burkhardt.</p>
<p> BORROWER   WUERTTEMBERGISCHE HYPOTHEKENBANK AG</p>
<p> AMT    1.0 BLN DEM   COUPON     5.0	 MATURITY    20.JAN.03</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  99.015    PAY DATE    20.JAN.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  0.275     LISTING    STUT	PAY FREQ    ANNUAL</p>
<p> MOODY/S&amp;P  =	   DENOMS (K) 1	   SALE LIMITS =</p>
<p> NOTES	OEFFENTLICHE PFANDBRIEF SERIES 832</p>
